  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 674.01 Termination of Financial Assistance.\n\n(a) Financial assistance shall terminate as of the end of the required advance notice period.\n\n(b) If the individual is potentially eligible for financial assistance under another category, assistance shall be determined without a separate application.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6531, INTERIM, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRES: 10-25-97; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #8452, eff 10-22-05; ss by #10471, eff 11-26-13; ss by #13648, eff 5-24-23",
